    "body": "## Live status reconciliation (2026-11-02)\n\nShared debt/branch ownership register: https://github.com/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/108\n\nIssue #105 remains OPEN and currently has no assignee. The related `follow-up/fz02-b2d-latent-token-cancellation-oct2026` branch exists but has no PR and has not been reviewed. PR #104 merged router/provider-stream resource cleanup only; it does not close this worker/workflow cancellation defect. The cancellation contract (re-raise vs distinct cancelled result vs hybrid), retry behavior and integration path still require an explicit owner decision before implementation. No implementation owner is assigned by this comment.",
